[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4496816088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119593#issuecomment-4496816088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119593","id":4496816088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDAf32A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-20T09:35:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T09:35:39Z","body":"Not a bug, this is intentional, see:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115575\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115572","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4496816088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4499393236","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119593#issuecomment-4499393236","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119593","id":4499393236,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDC9K1A","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-20T14:27:20Z","updated_at":"2026-05-20T15:05:18Z","body":"> Not a bug, this is intentional, see: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115575, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115572\n\nFrom what I read in the previous discussions, it still seems to be a regression:\n\n> The option was supposed to be hidden for foreign nodes (i.e. nodes belonging to another scene). Instance root is not a foreign node. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115572#issuecomment-3817503816\n\n...which was partially fixed in 4.6.1 when https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115575 got merged:\n\n| Godot Version | 4.5.1 | 4.6 | 4.6.1+ |\n| ------------- | ------------- | ------------- | ------------- |\n| Instanced scene child, as grandchild node of a normal scene (yellow) | `Rename` shown | `Rename` hidden | `Rename` hidden |\n| Instanced scene child, as child node of an inherited scene (yellow) | `Rename` shown | `Rename` hidden | `Rename` hidden |\n| Instanced scene root, as child node of a normal scene (white) | `Rename` shown | `Rename` hidden | `Rename` shown |\n| Instanced scene root, as root node of an inherited scene (white)  | `Rename` shown | `Rename` hidden | *`Rename` hidden |\n\nIn any case, the \"instanced scene root, as root node of an inherited scene\" can still be renamed by (double) left-clicking it, or by pressing F2, and it also does not have yellow text like other non-rename-able nodes.\n\nThis warning only appears when trying to rename a yellow node (by pressing F2 in 4.6.1+):\n<img width=\"247\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2baa760a-1236-45ab-bfd3-c89563c8a3c7\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4499393236/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4522011576","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119593#issuecomment-4522011576","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119593","id":4522011576,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDYhruA","user":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T19:11:32Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T08:00:39Z","body":"Found some closely related issues:\n- When the section includes a scene root, the \"Batch Rename\" button is missing.\n- When selecting a mix of child nodes, scene instances, and editable children, \"Rename\" and \"Batch Rename\" are sometimes incorrectly shown.\n- ~When selecting a mix of child nodes, scene instances, \"Change Type\" is sometimes incorrectly shown.~\n  - Similar to this issue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74236","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4522011576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]